   "text": "Plain HTTP routes (not MCP tools)\n\n/capabilities  /capabilities/refresh  /capabilities/{id}/gui\n/extensions  /commands  /commands/help\n/tickets  /ticket-admin   (stay up if capability off)\n/memory/owners/{uid}  /skills/owners/{uid}\n/pdf/ui  /media/ui  /pdf|media/files/{id}/download\n/upload  /upload/table  /upload/pdf\n/download?path=<opaque id>\n/brains/operation",
   "originalText": "Plain HTTP routes (not MCP tools)\n\n/capabilities  /capabilities/refresh  /capabilities/{id}/gui\n/extensions  /commands  /commands/help\n/tickets  /ticket-admin   (stay up if capability off)\n/memory/owners/{uid}  /skills/owners/{uid}\n/pdf/ui  /media/ui  /pdf|media/files/{id}/download\n/upload  /upload/table  /upload/pdf\n/download?path=<opaque id>\n/brains/operation",
