   "text": "src/capabilities/<name>/\n__init__.py      META = register(folder, id, label)\ncontract.py      Pydantic request/result models\ndomain.py        the logic; never imports mcp\nroutes.py         HTTP routes for ember_api (capability-owned)\ntool.py           @mcp.tool + @command, a few lines\nhelp.json         data for '/<id> help'\ngui/page.json  optional declarative page for ember_web\nREADME.md, STATIC-GUIDELINES.md\nutils/  static/   own stores and runtimes, reference data\n\noutside src/ (runtime state, gitignored)\nspecifics/<name>/.data .logs .cache .secrets\nspecifics/<name>/configs/  (tracked)",
