  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "kn_t",
   "x": 1266,
   "y": 3201.25,
   "width": 748,
   "height": 227.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 567212063,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 388428750,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What 'going online' does\n1  remove old tools, @command entries, META\n2  purge the folder's modules from sys.modules\n3  delete its __pycache__ (same-second edits)\n4  import tool.py inside capability_registry.capturing()\n5  save {enabled} to configs/config_capabilities.json\n\nRules\nA new folder is never auto-loaded, it stays offline\nEdit code: switch off then on. src/services edits need a restart\nPROCESS_LIFETIME_MODULES survive reloads (media_downloader)\nOne broken capability never takes the others down\nRenamed ids migrate on startup (video -> media)",
   "originalText": "What 'going online' does\n1  remove old tools, @command entries, META\n2  purge the folder's modules from sys.modules\n3  delete its __pycache__ (same-second edits)\n4  import tool.py inside capability_registry.capturing()\n5  save {enabled} to configs/config_capabilities.json\n\nRules\nA new folder is never auto-loaded, it stays offline\nEdit code: switch off then on. src/services edits need a restart\nPROCESS_LIFETIME_MODULES survive reloads (media_downloader)\nOne broken capability never takes the others down\nRenamed ids migrate on startup (video -> media)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "kn",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseline": 12
  },
