   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Identity and trust\nrequester = X-Requester-* headers or\ntool _meta.requester, never a tool parameter\nowner data keyed on account uid (rename-safe)\nnon-loopback bind without INTERNAL_API_TOKEN:\nidentity tools refuse",
   "originalText": "Identity and trust\nrequester = X-Requester-* headers or\ntool _meta.requester, never a tool parameter\nowner data keyed on account uid (rename-safe)\nnon-loopback bind without INTERNAL_API_TOKEN:\nidentity tools refuse",
   "fontSize": 14,
