   "text": "JobWatcher  (server_manager/utils/watcher.py)\nthread, backoff schedule, state files,\ncancel, resume at startup\nServerWatcher: poll 30 s for 10 min, then 5 min\nemails the starter on crash; error batch <= 1/hour",
